# reinforteach — Teardown

Pseudocode runbook. Reverts OpenClaw configuration changes from setup.pseudo.
Does NOT remove installed files (CUDA, Python packages, llama.cpp, model GGUF).

## Args

| Arg | Description |
|---|---|
| `--agent-id` | Target agent ID in `openclaw.json` to revert |
| `--original-model` | Original model to restore (default: `dashscope/qwen3.6-plus`) |
| `--config` | Path to `openclaw.json` (default: `~/.openclaw/openclaw.json`) |

---

## STEP 1 — Restore agent model

```
read {config} as JSON

target_agent = agents[{agent_id}]
if target_agent.model.primary == "openai/Qwen3.5-9B":
    target_agent.model.primary = "{original_model}"

if agents.defaults.model.primary == "openai/Qwen3.5-9B":
    agents.defaults.model.primary = "{original_model}"

write {config} back
```

---

## STEP 2 — Remove custom provider config

```
read {config} as JSON

# Remove Qwen3.5-9B from openai provider catalog
openai_models = models.providers.openai.models
if exists:
    remove any entry where id == "Qwen3.5-9B"
    if openai_models is now empty:
        delete models.providers.openai.models

# Remove baseUrl/apiKey/api from openai provider if they were added for local routing
openai_prov = models.providers.openai
if openai_prov.baseUrl == "http://localhost:8080/v1":
    delete openai_prov.baseUrl
    delete openai_prov.apiKey
    delete openai_prov.api

# Remove model catalog entry
if agents.defaults.models["openai/Qwen3.5-9B"] exists:
    delete agents.defaults.models["openai/Qwen3.5-9B"]

# Revert contextTokens and timeoutSeconds if they were set for local model
if agents.defaults.contextTokens == 65536:
    delete agents.defaults.contextTokens
if agents.defaults.timeoutSeconds == 1800:
    delete agents.defaults.timeoutSeconds

write {config} back
```

---

## STEP 3 — Remove reinforteach plugin config

```
read {config} as JSON

# Remove from allow list
if "reinforteach" in plugins.allow:
    remove "reinforteach" from plugins.allow

# Remove plugin entry
if plugins.entries["reinforteach"] exists:
    delete plugins.entries["reinforteach"]

# Remove from load paths
if "C:\Users\seval\reinforteach" in plugins.load.paths:
    remove it from plugins.load.paths

write {config} back
```

---

## STEP 4 — Clean up auth profiles

```
AUTH_PROFILES_PATH = "~/.openclaw/agents/{agent_id}/agent/auth-profiles.json"
read AUTH_PROFILES_PATH as JSON

if "openai:local" in profiles:
    delete profiles["openai:local"]

if lastGood.openai == "openai:local":
    delete lastGood.openai

write AUTH_PROFILES_PATH back
```

---

## STEP 5 — Stop llama.cpp daemon

```
run: Stop-Process -Name "llama-server" -Force -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue

STARTUP_DIR = "$env:APPDATA\Microsoft\Windows\Start Menu\Programs\Startup"
if {STARTUP_DIR}\llama-cpp-server.cmd exists:
    delete {STARTUP_DIR}\llama-cpp-server.cmd

validate: Invoke-RestMethod "http://localhost:8080/health" returns connection refused
```

---

## STEP 6 — Restart gateway and verify

```
run: openclaw gateway restart
wait 5 seconds

validate:
  openclaw models status shows agent model == "{original_model}"
  no "reinforteach: config loaded" in gateway logs
  no "reinforteach: starting scheduler" in gateway logs
  openai:local not in auth profiles

print: "reinforteach config reverted"
print: "  agent model: {original_model}"
print: "  plugin: removed from openclaw.json"
print: "  llama.cpp daemon: stopped"
print: "  installed files preserved (CUDA, Python, llama.cpp, model GGUF)"
```
